"{\"edits\":[{\"start\":6,\"end\":7,\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J11@2027-01-15T23:30-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T23:40\",\"n\":\"Aeroplan economy — same departure, latest arrival\",\"v\":\"Also departs SFO at 11:30 p.m. January 15, but arrives Bangkok at 11:40 p.m. January 17, via TPE on BR. It reports 65,000 Aeroplan points and CAD 116.50 taxes, again with unknown quote scope, and one seat; the minimum-seat check passes for one traveler. Its TPE connection is 905 minutes. The reported cabin is economy; cabin by leg is not provided. Unlike the other 11:30 p.m. option, it uses BR only rather than BR and TG.\"}]}]}"
